<title>USA: Richardson Electronics officer resigns.</title>
<headline>Richardson Electronics officer resigns.</headline>
<dateline>LAFOX, Ill. 1997-01-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Richardson Electronics Ltd said Wednesday Dennis Gandy, executive vice president of corporate development will resign as an officer and director effective February 28, 1997.</p>
<p>According to an agreement reached with the company, Gandy will continue as a consultant for several years. Gandy has worked for the company for 25 years.</p>
<p>No successor was disclosed.</p>
<p>Richardson Electronics distributes and makes electron tubes and power semiconductors.</p>
<p>		((Chicago newsdesk 312 408 8787))</p>
